{"tool_name":"angiogenesis--sprout-analyzer-(imagej)","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The <strong>Sprout Morphology</strong> plugin measures sprout <em>number</em>, <em>length</em>, <em>width</em> and <em>cell density</em> of endothelial cell (EC) sprouts grown in a bead sprouting assay. It optionally includes measuring the coverage of these sprouts with pericytes included in the assay, as well as the endothelial cell/pericyte ratio.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The <strong>Sprout Morphology</strong> plugin measures sprout <em>number</em>, <em>length</em>, <em>width</em> and <em>cell density</em> of endothelial cell (EC) sprouts grown in a bead sprouting assay. It optionally includes measuring the coverage of these sprouts with pericytes included in the assay, as well as the endothelial cell/pericyte ratio.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-27T14:56:09+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-05-16T10:01:34+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1494929198,"last_comment_uid":1,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Jan Ellinger"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4557,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"39ff4803-2f42-4bb7-bee7-f42fdb163829","url":"/taxonomy/term/4557"},{"target_id":4415,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"d8d97a14-4994-4f6a-a1f5-d621dcf9f3b3","url":"/taxonomy/term/4415"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":1,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"ff7211b9-a937-4c33-aac3-22aa10053480","url":"/user/1"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4204,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation__R9Qf06vxvFj2UbAk7pW3IMG","url":"/filament-tracing"},{"target_id":4026,